<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/16th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Battle</p><h1 class="enc-title">Battle of Gravelines (1558)</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1558</span> · Part of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italian-war-of-1551-1559">Italian War of 1551–1559</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Battle of Gravelines was fought on 13 July 1558 near Gravelines on the coast of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/flanders">Flanders</a>. A Spanish army under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lamoral-count-of-egmont">Lamoral, Count of Egmont</a>, supported by fire from English ships, destroyed a French force under Marshal de <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tiermes">Termes</a> that had raided <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dunkirk">Dunkirk</a>. Together with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/saint-quentin">Saint-Quentin</a> the year before, the victory pushed <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/france">France</a> to accept the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/peace-of-cateau-cambresis">Peace of Cateau-Cambrésis</a> in 1559.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-gravelines-1558.jpg" alt="Battle of Gravelines (1558)" width="320" height="222" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Eccoui_amantsmi_lectori_il_vero_sito_della_battaglia_data_nel_anno_1558_a_di_13_di_luglio_intorno_a_Gravellina..._-_btv1b550000120.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
